				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:a+b*c}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**Priorité.** La multiplication se calcule **avant** l'addition et la soustraction.",
					"$${{a}} + \\textcolor{{{color:primary.1}}}{{{b}} \\times {{c}}} = {{a}} + \\textcolor{{{color:primary.1}}}{{{eval:b*c}}} = \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{solution}}}$$"
